  Delta V^Pauli LDA-XC:                 -0.178633895014892         -4.8609          -112.09          -469.00
  Delta V^Pauli GGA-Exchange:            0.033432332533734          0.9097            20.98            87.78
  Delta V^Pauli GGA-Correlation:        -0.029798330628593         -0.8109           -18.70           -78.24
                                      --------------------     -----------       ----------      -----------
